OL,3,GNEWSATwo men guilty of murdering
OL,4,A19-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 19-year-old father in Kent.
OL,9,FFollowing a trial at Canterbury Crown
OL,10,FCourt which lasted more than two weeks,
OL,11,Fa jury found Kieron Barnes, 20, and
OL,12,FTobias Agbaje, 21, guilty of murder
OL,13,Fover the fatal attack on 3 April.
OL,15,FPolice were called to Belmont Road,
OL,16,FWhitstable, where Ashton Harrington was
OL,17,Ffound seriously injured.
OL,19,FEmergency services found the teenager
OL,20,Fhad stopped breathing and had suffered
OL,21,Fmultiple stab wounds. He died at the
OL,22,Fscene.
